    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Data must be hosted within the EU, with no transfer outside the EU, and sensitive data must be protected through encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and measures should we implement to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with The tender strict GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, and confidentiality of client data requirements, we, can implement several security controls and measures based on we existing capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, as we are already ISO 27001 certified since 2023, with a scope that includes Development, delivery, and operations, we have a robust foundation for managing information security. certified demonstrates we commitment to securing sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data protection, we can ensure that all personal data is processed in accordance with GDPR Article 28, as stated in we Data Protection Measures under DPA alignment. we will utilize encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, ensuring the confidentiality and integrity of client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the requirement for strict partitioning of client files with no leakage of data between client files, we can implement we existing capability of \"Strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission; access controls prevent any cross-client circulation of data\" as mentioned under Client File Partitioning in we data protection measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that each client's data is isolated and protected from unauthorized access." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For hosting data within the EU, we can leverage we partnership with OuraneCloud, which provides a SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure. our partnership with OuraneCloud, which provides a SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure aligns with the requirement for hosting sensitive data within a secure, the EU-based environment, ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with GDPR regulations regarding data localization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, we will apply encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant, as part of our data protection measures. we key management is based on an the EU-based infrastructure, further ensuring that control over encrypted data remains within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we existing security controls include secure SDLC practices such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider of equivalent CREST level. we also have a vulnerability management process with Remediation SLAs by severity and an incident response plan that includes detection, notification, and remediation, aligning with the 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures, we can ensure compliance with The tender requirements for GDPR, professional secrecy, confidentiality of client data, and strict partitioning of client files, while also protecting sensitive data through encryption and pseudonymisation within an the EU-hosted environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender involves processing personal data, which is subject to GDPR regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client also requires respect for professional secrecy, auditor independence, and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are there any specific legal risks or considerations that we should flag in we response, and how can we demonstrate compliance with the relevant regulatory frameworks?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Legal Agent for we, I must emphasize that we is familiar with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy, and we are well-versed in maintaining the confidentiality of client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR regulations, we ensures that we complies with the obligations monitored under the regulatory compliance framework, including GDPR (Article 28 processing agreements)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate compliance with the relevant regulatory frameworks, we can highlight that we contractual framework is designed to respect professional secrecy and confidentiality. we can also provide standard administrative attestations, which include attestations related to we compliance with up-to-date social and fiscal obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's essential to note that as a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, we are committed to respecting the legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we professional liability insurance coverage of 10 million euros per claim provides an added layer of protection for we clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific legal risks or considerations, it's crucial to flag the importance of ensuring that our contractual framework does not compromise we professional obligations, particularly regarding auditor independence and separation of duties. we must also emphasize the need for strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data throughout the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing particularly regarding auditor independence and separation of duties, we can demonstrate we commitment to complying with the relevant regulatory frameworks and mitigate potential legal risks associated with processing personal data and respecting professional secrecy, auditor independence, and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project budget is €220,000 over 3 years, with an emphasis on controlling annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's pricing model and current financial position, what is our company's projected margin on this contract, and are there any cost-optimization strategies our company's can propose to the client while ensuring the expected quality of service? our company's financial context indicates that an engagement of €220,000 over 3 years is well within our company's normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's annual revenue and near break-even financial result, our company's aim to maintain a target gross margin between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To project our projected margin on this contract, let's consider The project budget. our company's daily rates for various roles are provided, but without specific details on the resource allocation for this contract, it's challenging to calculate our projected margin on this contract." ;
