    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's can propose cost-optimization strategies that favor cost-efficient tiers and models, which protect the gross margin and ensure predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One potential strategy is to opt for the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, which is noted as the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side. opt would help in controlling annual operating costs while maintaining an acceptable margin. our company's could also explore optimizing the hosting and inference costs, as the hosting and inference costs are identified as main recurring cost drivers that vary with the hosting tier and model option selected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By proposing such cost-optimization strategies, our company's can work with the client to ensure the expected quality of service is met while keeping this contract within the budget envelope and achieving our company's targeted gross margin range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach aligns with our company's financial capacity and the emphasis on controlling annual operating costs as specified in the project constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client seeks an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and quality of work while preserving professional secrecy and reliability of figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy should we design for this tender response, considering we LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, and performance benchmarks?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, we can leverage we core strengths in AI and innovation. we Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach, which grounds answers in validated material, can help preserve professional secrecy and ensure the reliability of figures.  we should design an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that incorporates we hybrid retrieval capabilities, allowing for both lexical and semantic searches. design will enable the system to provide accurate and relevant information to The client professionals, improving the client's professionals productivity and work quality. we template-guided drafting capability can assist in generating professional documents, such as client letters and mission notes, while ensuring that professional documents, such as client letters and mission notes are reliable and grounded in cited sources." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client concern about preserving professional secrecy and reliability of figures, we can utilize we explainability features, including source citations, retrieved passages, and retrieval traces. our explainability features, including source citations, retrieved passages, and retrieval traces will provide transparency into how the system arrives at the system answers, enabling professionals to validate the outputs. we fine-tuning methods can be applied to adapt the model to The client specific needs and corpus of documents, further enhancing the system performance and relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we should adopt an iterative approach, working closely with The client experts to curate the corpus, tune the retrieval, and design prompts and templates that meet their specific use cases." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This collaborative methodology will ensure that we solution meets The client requirements and integrates seamlessly into The client existing practices. we performance benchmarks, which measure answer quality based on groundedness, relevance, factual support, and correctness of cited figures, will be essential in evaluating the system effectiveness and identifying areas for improvement during the pilot phase." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI components and innovation strategies, we can design a comprehensive solution that meets the client's needs while showcasing we expertise in AI and innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair Associés aims to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can Cabinet Vauclair Associés incorporate sustainable practices into Cabinet Vauclair Associés proposed solution, such as using green hosting partners, reducing energy consumption, and promoting digital sobriety, while also highlighting Cabinet Vauclair Associés EcoVadis rating and social commitments?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at Cabinet Vauclair Associés, I can assure that Cabinet Vauclair Associés prioritizes sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair Associés have already conducted a bilan carbone and have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair Associés green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is located in the EU and uses renewable energy, with a PUE of 1.2 and heat reuse capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of missions between collaborators by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress client file, and an efficient resumption by another collaborator.  4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with Cabinet Vauclair Associés goal of relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further reduce Cabinet Vauclair Associés environmental footprint, Cabinet Vauclair Associés practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair Associés inference efficiency also serves as an energy lever, minimizing the energy required for Cabinet Vauclair Associés operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Cabinet Vauclair Associés have a carbon reporting capability to ensure transparency in Cabinet Vauclair Associés sustainability efforts." ;
